						<source><pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">A beam is connected through a hinge on the left and a hinging slider on the right. It is subjected to a load of <ph id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:inline-math"/>.</pc><ph id="c3" type="ui" subType="swi18n:component-1"/><pc id="c4" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">Draw the free body diagram.</pc><pc id="c5" type="ui" subType="swi18n:input-space" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="c6" type="ui" subType="swi18n:component-1"/></pc><pc id="c7" type="ui" subType="swi18n:par" swi18n:slot="children">Calculate the unknown support reactions.</pc></source>
